---
// Nativised static page (REBUILD-PLAN.md section 11). Real Astro markup, no
// WebflowPage.astro shell splicing. Body markup below is lifted verbatim from
// src/shells/developers/ecosystem/body.{0,0.post,1..11,11.post}.html and kept as
// literal template content -- every <style>/<script> in it carries is:inline, and
// every inter-tag whitespace run that contained a newline in the original shell has
// been collapsed to a single literal space, both per REBUILD-PLAN.md section 11.
//
// The tracking/embed block (body.0.html) and the runtime script tail
// (body.11.post.html) are byte-identical to the other developers/* shells, so
// they're factored into DevelopersTrackingCodes.astro / DevelopersRuntime.astro
// instead of duplicated here (verified: this route's own copies matched those
// components byte-for-byte, is:inline aside). Nav/footer variant is "developers"
// (not "developers-nested" -- that's developers/home), per src/shells/manifest.json,
// which is what the current WebflowPage.astro render already uses for this route.
//
// 11 CMS lists ("blueprints-developers", one per category tab), item SELECTION kept
// from src/bindings/_lists.json, field VALUES resolved live through Astro content
// collections. list.7 ("Gaming") is a CONFIRMED empty list -- 0 items on live, not an
// unresolved binding -- src/lib/static-lists.ts already renders that as the
// w-dyn-empty branch with no special-casing needed here.
//
// Every item template is IDENTICAL across all 11 tabs (byte-for-byte in the export),
// but `showIcon` reproduces a genuine PER-LIST Webflow field-binding difference:
// verified against reference/live/developers/ecosystem.html that the Stablecoins,
// Lending and Insurance tabs never render the icon background-image, even for items
// (DegenFi, DeMIFI) whose `icon` field points at the exact same shared placeholder
// asset that DOES render in every other tab -- so those 3 Collection List instances
// simply never had the Icon field bound, independent of item content. See
// src/components/developers/BlueprintCard.astro for the rest (including the CTA
// button, which isn't in _lists.json's slots at all -- the deriver only handles
// text/attr:style binds, not a Link field's two-variant conditional markup).
//
// THREE GENUINE _lists.json BUGS FOUND AND FIXED, all the same shape: the slug
// "scrypto-bonding" standing in for a DIFFERENT item that live actually renders.
// Verified position-by-position against reference/live/developers/ecosystem.html's
// per-tab name/username pairs, cross-checked against
// reference/webflow/items/blueprints-developers.json (all replacement slugs exist,
// none draft/archived):
//   ecosystem#0 "Decentralized Exchanges": stored
//     [caviarswap, ociswap, scrypto-bonding, scrypto-bonding, scrypto-bonding, scrypto-bonding]
//     (6 items, 1 real slug repeated 4x) but live renders 6 DISTINCT projects --
//     positions 3-6 corrected to [radex, scrypto-bonding, hareswap, chaindex]
//     (RaDEX/@0xOmar, Scrypto-Bonding/@devmannic, HareSwap/@devmannic, ChainDEX/@FR05T8YTE).
//   ecosystem#8 "Oracles": stored [neuracle, scrypto-bonding], live's 2nd item is
//     CallbackScheduler/backyard-coder -> corrected to [neuracle, callbackscheduler].
//   ecosystem#9 "DAOs & Governance": stored [adept, impahla, scrypto-bonding], live's
//     3rd item is Crowd Sourcing/@Kansuler -> corrected to [adept, impahla, crowd-sourcing].
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';
import SiteHead from '../../components/site/SiteHead.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/site/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/site/SiteFooter.astro';
import DevelopersTrackingCodes from '../../components/developers/DevelopersTrackingCodes.astro';
import DevelopersRuntime from '../../components/developers/DevelopersRuntime.astro';
import BlueprintCard from '../../components/developers/BlueprintCard.astro';
import { staticListItems } from '../../lib/static-lists';

const currentPath = '/developers/ecosystem';
const headTail = readFileSync('src/components/developers/developers-head.html', 'utf8');

const list0 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#0');
const list1 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#1');
const list2 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#2');
const list3 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#3');
const list4 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#4');
const list5 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#5');
const list6 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#6');
const list7 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#7');
const list8 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#8');
const list9 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#9');
const list10 = await staticListItems('developers/ecosystem#10');
---
<!doctype html>
<html data-wf-page="69ee5ee77abc2bbc1daf5746" data-wf-site="6053f7fca5bf627283b582c2" lang="en">
  <head>
    <SiteHead
      title="Radix - DeFi Ecosystem"
      description="The future of DeFi is being built with Scrypto. See the expanding Radix ecosystem, and submit your own blueprints."
      ogTitle="Radix - DeFi Ecosystem"
      ogDescription="The future of DeFi is being built with Scrypto. See the expanding Radix ecosystem, and submit your own blueprints."
      twitterTitle="Radix - DeFi Ecosystem"
      twitterDescription="The future of DeFi is being built with Scrypto. See the expanding Radix ecosystem, and submit your own blueprints."
      ogType
      twitterCard
      canonical="https://www.radixdlt.com/developers/ecosystem"
      tail={headTail}
    />
  </head>
  <body>
<DevelopersTrackingCodes /><SiteNav variant="developers" currentPath={currentPath} /> <div class="c-defi-img"> <div class="container-sticky is-stikcy-img"> <div class="c-clip-defi is-right"><img src="/images/img-right.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="clip-defi right"></div> <div class="c-clip-defi"><img src="/images/img-left.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="clip-defi"></div> </div> </div> <div class="c-section-sticky is_center top-defi"> <div class="container-sticky is-small top"> <div class="bm_40"> <h4>Our community is building the foundations of a…</h4> </div> <div class="bm_40"> <h1><span class="t_gradient full">Radix DeFi Ecosystem</span></h1> </div> <div class="bm_60"> <h5>What will you build with Scrypto?</h5> </div> <div class="flex-default bm-20"> <div class="c_button-inline"> <a href="/developers/home" class="t_button-2 mr-20 w-inline-block"> <div>Get Started Building</div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="c-bg-section-3 alt"> <div class="c-defi-holder"> <div class="triangle-title"> <div class="container-sticky is-zindex"><img width="113" loading="lazy" alt="" src="/images/Scrypto-Icon-Round-1.png"></div> <div class="c-skew-holder-7 alt inverted"><img sizes="(max-width: 4096px) 100vw, 4096px" srcset="/images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-500.png 500w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-800.png 800w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted-p-3200.png 3200w, /images/triangle-hero-inverted.png 4096w" alt="" src="/images/triangle-hero-inverted.png" loading="eager" class="image-85"></div> </div> <div class="container-sticky is-small"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h3>A World of Possibilities</h3> </div> <div class="bm_60 m_30"> <p>Radix dApps are built as smart contract “blueprints” written in <a href="https://developers.radixdlt.com" class="link-white-2">Scrypto</a>.<br>Scrypto makes it easy and secure to build powerful DeFi functionality because assets are a first-class feature.</p> </div> <div class="bm_40"><img sizes="(max-width: 1538px) 100vw, 1538px" srcset="/images/Scrypto-p-500.avif 500w, /images/Scrypto-p-800.avif 800w, /images/Scrypto.avif 1538w" alt="" src="/images/Scrypto.avif" loading="lazy" class="c-default"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/coding-screen-mobile-p-500.png 500w, /images/coding-screen-mobile.png 770w" alt="" src="/images/coding-screen-mobile.png" loading="lazy" class="c-mobile"></div> <p>Scrypto is now available in &quot;early access&quot; form with Alexandria, enabling developers to start building and testing. On-ledger deployment of Scrypto begins with <a href="https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-roadmap" class="link-white-2">Babylon</a>, expected for July 2023release.</p> </div> </div> <div id="dApps" class="c-content"> <div class="container-sticky"> <div class="c-tab-section is-alt"> <div data-current="Decentralized Exchanges" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="w-tabs"> <div class="c-tabs-menu w-tab-menu"> <a data-w-tab="Decentralized Exchanges" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/icon-DEX.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Decentralized Exchanges</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Stablecoins" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/icon-stablecoin.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Stablecoins</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Lending" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-LENDING.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Lending</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Insurance" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-NFTS-1.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Insurance</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Futures, Options, &amp; Derivatives" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-FUTURES.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Futures, Options, &amp; Derivatives</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Portfolio Management &amp; Yield Farming" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-PORTFOLIO.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Portfolio Management &amp; Yield Farming</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="NFT" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-NFTS.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>NFT</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Gaming" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-GAMING.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Gaming</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Oracles" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-ORACLES.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Oracles</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="DAOs &amp; Governance" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-WALLETS_1.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>DAOs &amp; Governance</div> </a> <a data-w-tab="Other" class="eco-tabs w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ICON-OTHER.svg" alt="" class="icon-eco"> <div>Other</div> </a> </div> <div class="w-tab-content"> <div data-w-tab="Decentralized Exchanges" class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Decentralized Exchanges</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>Decentralized Exchanges, also known as DEXes, allow users to exchange two or more tokens in a single transaction, at a certain price, without the need for another party to facilitate the transaction.</p> <p><br></p> <p>DEXes allow users to trade assets without the need for a trusted third party. They are the first ever examples of a censorship resistant, non-custodial, and permissionless way of exchanging assets electronically.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://uniswap.org/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/dapp1_1dapp1.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Uniswap</div> </a> <a href="https://pancakeswap.finance/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/pancakeswap-cake-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>PancakeSwap</div> </a> <a href="https://sushi.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/dapp2_1dapp2.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Sushiswap</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list0.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list0.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Radiswap - An AMM type DEX blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/radiswap" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Stablecoins" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Stablecoins</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>A stablecoin is a class of cryptocurrencies that attempt to offer price stability and are backed by a reserve asset. Stablecoins have become popular as they provide the instant processing and security or privacy of cryptocurrencies&#x27; payments along with the volatility-free stable valuations of fiat currencies.</p> <p>‍</p> <p>Stablecoins base their market value on an external reference. This could be a currency like the U.S. dollar or a commodity&#x27;s price such as gold. Stablecoins achieve price stability via collateralization or algorithmic buying and selling of the reference asset or its derivatives.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://makerdao.com/en/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/dai-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Dai</div> </a> <a href="https://www.circle.com/en/usdc" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/usd-coin-usdc-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>USDC</div> </a> <a href="https://tether.to/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/tether-usdt-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Tether</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list1.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list1.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={false} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">hello-world - A simple token issuance blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/core/hello-world" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Lending" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Lending</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>In lending, borrowers pledge their crypto assets as collateral and avail loans in stablecoins or other crypto assets as a means of financing.</p> <p>‍</p> <p>However, unlike TradFi, DeFi lending uses algorithmic systems where lending and borrowing rates are determined automatically based on each asset&#x27;s real-time supply and demand. </p> <p>‍</p> <p>This automated approach means more flexibility and access for anyone looking for financing.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://aave.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/aave-aave-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Aave</div> </a> <a href="https://compound.finance/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/compound-comp-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Compound</div> </a> <a href="https://truefi.io/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/TrueFi.jpg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>TrueFi</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list2.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list2.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={false} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">auto-lend - A collateralized lending blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/auto-lend" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Insurance" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Insurance</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>Insurance protocols provide cover against smart contract failure &amp; exchange hacks using a decentralized protocol, so people can share risk without needing an insurance company.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://nexusmutual.io/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/nexus.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Nexus Mutual</div> </a> <a href="https://opium.finance/academy/opium-insurance/academyinsurance/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/opium.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Opium Insurance</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list3.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list3.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={false} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Futures, Options, &amp; Derivatives" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Futures, Options, &amp; Derivatives</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p><strong>Futures</strong></p> <p>A futures contract is an arrangement between two users on an exchange to buy and sell an underlying crypto asset at an agreed-upon price on a certain date in the future.</p> <p>‍</p> <p><strong>Options</strong></p> <p>Options give the holder the right to buy (call) or sell (put) an underlying crypto asset at a set date without being obligated. </p> <p>‍</p> <p><strong>Synthetic Assets</strong></p> <p>Synthetic assets, also known as synths, are an asset class formed by combining cryptocurrencies and traditional derivative assets, making them tokenized derivatives.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://www.perp.fi/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/perpetual.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Perpetual</div> </a> <a href="https://www.hegic.co/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/hegic.jpg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Hegic</div> </a> <a href="https://synthetix.io/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/synthetix-network-token-snx-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Synthetix</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list4.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list4.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Synthetics - A synthetic asset issuance blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/synthetics" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">X-perp-futures - A perpetual futures blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/x-perp-futures" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Portfolio Management &amp; Yield Farming" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Portfolio Management &amp; Yield Farming</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p><strong>Portfolio Management</strong></p> <p>Automated asset management lowers the barrier to entry for the regular users looking to invest in crypto. Instead of managing multiple accounts and wallets, crypto asset management platforms simplify the process by consolidating the user&#x27;s holdings while simultaneously providing improved portfolio management tools, resulting in better returns.</p> <p>‍<a href="https://www.setprotocol.com/"></a> </p> <p><strong>Yield farming</strong></p> <p>Yield farming is the practice of staking or lending crypto assets to create high returns or rewards in the form of additional cryptocurrency. Yield farming protocols incentivize liquidity providers (LP) to stake or lock up their crypto assets in a smart contract-based liquidity pool. These incentives can be a percentage of transaction fees, interest from lenders, or a governance token.<a href="https://yearn.finance/"></a><br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://www.dhedge.org/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/dhedge.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>dHedge</div> </a> <a href="https://harvest.finance/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/harvest.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Harvest Finance</div> </a> <a href="https://yearn.finance/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/yearn-finance-yfi-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Yearn Finance</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list5.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list5.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Mutual-farm - A yield farming blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/mutual-farm" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="NFT" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>NFT</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>NFTs are unique digital items such as collectibles or artworks or game items. As an artist, you both ensure that it is unique and brand it as your work by tokenizing your work. The actual ownership is blockchain-managed.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://opensea.io/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/opensea.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>OpenSea</div> </a> <a href="https://nftstars.app/en/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/nftstars.jpg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>NFT Stars</div> </a> <a href="https://rarible.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/rarible.jpeg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Rarible</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list6.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list6.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Hello NFT - A simple NFT issuance blueprint</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/core/hello-nft" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Sporting event - A blueprint using NFTs for sectioned event tickets</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/nft/sporting-event" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Gaming" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Gaming</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>Since we have so many gamers who spend endless hours and money on gaming platforms, DeFi gaming platforms will enable them to monetize their time and progress. The play-to-earn games offer the best of both worlds - they provide an entertaining experience and make playing games lucrative.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://axieinfinity.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/axie-infinity-axs-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Axie Infinity</div> </a> <a href="https://splinterlands.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/splinterlands.avif" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Splinterlands</div> </a> <a href="https://decentraland.org/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/decentraland.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Decentraland</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list7.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list7.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="Oracles" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>Oracles</h2> </div> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>An oracle acts as a reliable data source and sends data from the outside physical world, such as match scores or current market value of stocks or currencies, to a blockchain. An interacting app can then use this data to decide if the specified contract requirements are fulfilled or not, based on which, whether to dispense money and to whom. <br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://chain.link/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/chainlink-link-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Chainlink</div> </a> <a href="https://makerdao.com/en/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/dai-logo.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>MakerDAO</div> </a> <a href="https://bandprotocol.com/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/bp.jpg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>Band Protocol</div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="c-cms-holder"> <div class="main_blueprints"> <div class="c-blueprint-title"> <div class="div-block-364"> <div class="div-block-365"> <h3>Community Projects &amp; Blueprints</h3> </div> <div class="div-block-363"> <a href="https://docs.radixdlt.com/main/scrypto/scrypto-lang/blueprints-and-components.html" target="_blank" class="link-blue-2">What is a blueprint?</a> </div> </div> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/scrypto-developer-program-incentives" target="_blank" class="t_button-2 is-extended w-inline-block"> <div>Submit Your Project or Blueprint</div> </a> </div> <div class="blueprint_holder w-dyn-list"> {list8.length > 0 ? (<div role="list" class="c-scroll-2 w-dyn-items">{list8.map((item) => (<BlueprintCard item={item} showIcon={true} />))}</div>) : (<div class="w-dyn-empty"> <div>No items found.</div> </div>)} </div> </div> <div class="c-related-title"> <h3>Related example Scrypto code</h3> </div> <div class="c-related"> <div class="related-block"> <div class="icon-holder is-related"></div> <div class="c-b-holder"> <div class="c-b-top"> <div class="c-name alt">Price-oracle - A simple oracle respository for price data</div> </div> </div> <div class="c-b-link-holder"> <a href="https://github.com/radixdlt/scrypto-examples/tree/main/defi/price-oracle" class="t_button-2 is_alt_btn-dark-github">Github</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-w-tab="DAOs &amp; Governance" class="w-tab-pane"> <div class="eco-tab-pane"> <div class="bm_40 m_30"> <h2>DAOs &amp; Governance</h2> </div> <div class="top-section"> <div class="c-tabs-rt w-richtext"> <p>Decentralized Autonomous Organizations, also known as DAOs, are an exciting new form of collective action closely related to the general category of Governance. DAOs often allow groups of people to make decisions, gather and spend funds, or otherwise come together as a group in a way that is fair, transparent, and decentralized.<br></p> </div> <div class="dapps_holder hide"> <div class="bm-20"> <h5>Popular dApps today</h5> </div> <a href="https://metamask.io/" target="_blank" class="link-dapp w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/MetaMask_Fox.svg" alt="" class="dappp-logo"> <div>MetaMask</div> </a> <a href="http